{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nightmare business trip is back with a vengeance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be spending a horror filled 3 nights at the hotel. Your room this time around, is a rather large one complete with a bed and bath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you find anomalies, call the reception to have them change rooms. If everything looks fine, go to bed and have a good night.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Next Business Trip&quot; is a short game in first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It takes about 30 to 60 minutes to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are very simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse and WASD keys for walking. Left click to select and right click to zoom only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are prone to motion sickness, please lower the sensitivity of the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a horror game where players must spot anomalies in a closed room to escape. Inspired by The Exit 8.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to make your own video streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, you are responsible for any damage caused by posting and distributing videos.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3659150?t=1748943788","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3659150?t=1748943788","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659150/1548c32a494dbcba4d24a95a59423d5f22d5021b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748943788","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659150/1548c32a494dbcba4d24a95a59423d5f22d5021b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748943788","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nightmare business trip is back with a vengeance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be spending a horror filled 3 nights at the hotel. Your room this time around, is a rather large one complete with a bed and bath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you find anomalies, call the reception to have them change rooms. If everything looks fine, go to bed and have a good night.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Next Business Trip&quot; is a short game in first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It takes about 30 to 60 minutes to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are very simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse and WASD keys for walking. Left click to select and right click to zoom only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are prone to motion sickness, please lower the sensitivity of the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a horror game where players must spot anomalies in a closed room to escape. Inspired by The Exit 8.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to make your own video streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, you are responsible for any damage caused by posting and distributing videos.</p>","developers":["Gonta"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659150/cee6b4b7f2b588e55bdedffdc808d117d70c0377/header.jpg?t=1748943788","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3659150/869273/aa61a2d046a49f35a168dc72478b4224e3986e10/1750417244/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746091907","dash_h264":"https://v